# P13 batch 4
#. event 00 (look)
msgctxt "bark 0344:00AB"
msgid "dead beggar "
msgstr "死去的乞丐"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 00 (look)
msgctxt "bark 0344:00CB"
msgid "beggar "
msgstr "乞丐"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 11 (leaveFastArea)
msgctxt "bark 0344:020A"
msgid "Help! I'm being oppressed! "
msgstr "救命！有人欺壓我！"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 11 (leaveFastArea)
msgctxt "bark 0344:0238"
msgid "Argh! I'm being attacked! "
msgstr "呃啊！有人攻擊我！"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0344:029A"
msgid "Hello... "
msgstr "你好……"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0344:02BD"
msgid "Greetings... "
msgstr "你好……"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0344:0353"
msgid "Do you have any old coins you don't want? "
msgstr "你有不要的舊錢幣嗎？"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0344:0394"
msgid "How's about helpin' out a poor cripple? "
msgstr "幫幫可憐的瘸子怎麼樣？"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0344:042C"
msgid "Here you go. "
msgstr "拿去吧。"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0344:046C"
msgid "Thank you, my friend. "
msgstr "謝謝你，朋友。"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0344:04AD"
msgid "And, as a word of warning remember this... "
msgstr "還有，給你個忠告，記住這句話……"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0344:04F0"
msgid "Always look for traps within chests. "
msgstr "開箱子時永遠要提防陷阱。"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0344:0526"
msgid "No treasure is worth dying for. "
msgstr "沒有什麼寶藏值得拿命去換。"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0344:0577"
msgid "Do not use healing spells when you do not need to. "
msgstr "不需要的時候別用治療法術。"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0344:05B5"
msgid "They will do you more damage than good. "
msgstr "它們對你害處會比好處多。"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0344:060D"
msgid "Remember that sword is a friend in times of great danger, "
msgstr "記住，危急時刻劍是你的好朋友，"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0344:0664"
msgid "but a well placed boot can also bring down an undead stranger... "
msgstr "但踢得準的一腳，也能放倒不死的怪東西……"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0344:06BB"
msgid "Exploring the catacombs may be dangerous to your health. "
msgstr "探索地下墓穴可能有害你的健康。"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0344:070B"
msgid "Take care to map your route, lest you seal your own doom! "
msgstr "小心畫好你的路線，免得自尋死路！"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0344:0768"
msgid "Never try to kill a skeleton, for they are already the undead. "
msgstr "千萬別想殺死骷髏，因為它們本來就是不死者。"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0344:07D3"
msgid "Yellow shrooms with spots of green are very bad for your kidneys and spleen. "
msgstr "黃傘綠斑的蘑菇，吃了腎脾都受苦。"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0344:0835"
msgid "But yellow shrooms with spots of red will bring you back when you are dead. "
msgstr "黃傘紅斑的蘑菇，死了也能讓你復甦。"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0344:0877"
msgid "Children should be seen, not heard. "
msgstr "小孩子有耳無嘴。"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0344:08AC"
msgid "Thank you kindly, stranger. "
msgstr "多謝你了，陌生人。"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0344:08E2"
msgid "May Hydros find favor with you. "
msgstr "願海德羅斯眷顧你。"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0344:0930"
msgid "Sorry, I do not have any money. "
msgstr "抱歉，我沒有錢。"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0344:0959"
msgid "Maybe next time... "
msgstr "下次吧……"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0344:098F"
msgid "Oooops! "
msgstr "哎呀！"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0344:09C7"
msgid "Sorry, I do not have any money. "
msgstr "抱歉，我沒有錢。"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0344:09F0"
msgid "Maybe next time... "
msgstr "下次吧……"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0344:0A17"
msgid "Thanks anyway... "
msgstr "還是謝謝你……"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0344:0A4E"
msgid "Peasant! "
msgstr "鄉巴佬！"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0344:0A8F"
msgid "May the Lurker take ya! "
msgstr "讓潛伏者把你抓去吧！"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0344:0AE8"
msgid "May the minions of Lithos suck the marrow from your bones! "
msgstr "讓利索斯的爪牙吸乾你的骨髓！"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0344:0B33"
msgid "May you roast in Pyros' flames for all time! "
msgstr "讓你在派羅斯的烈焰裡永遠烤著！"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0344:0BFD"
msgid "Hey... "
msgstr "喂……"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0344:0C45"
msgid "Over here... "
msgstr "這邊……"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0344:0CA6"
msgid "Pssst... "
msgstr "噓……"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0344:0CCC"
msgid "You...! "
msgstr "你……！"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0344:0D0D"
msgid "Come here...! "
msgstr "過來……！"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0344:0D3D"
msgid "Get over here...! "
msgstr "給我過來……！"
